>Wortsman</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Age, vitamin D, and solar ultraviolet</article-title><source>Lancet</source><year>1989</year><volume>2</volume><fpage>1104</fpage><lpage>1105</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">2572832</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/S0140-6736(89)91124-0</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B12"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Holick</surname><given-names>MF</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Environmental factors that influence the cutaneous production of vitamin D</article-title><source>Am J Clin Nutr</source><year>1995</year><volume>61</volume><fpage>638S</fpage><lpage>645S</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">7879731</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B13"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Fassbender</surname><given-names>WJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Stumpf</surname><given-names>UC</given-names></name><name><surname>Jockenhovel</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>[Pharmacotherapy of osteoporosis: evidence-based clinical practice]</article-title><source>Med Klin (Munich)</source><year>2006</year><volume>101 Suppl 1</volume><fpage>173</fpage><lpage>177</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16802548</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B14"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Boonen</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Body</surname><given-names>JJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Boutsen</surname><given-names>Y</given-names></name><name><surname>Devogelaer</surname><given-names>JP</given-names></name><name><surname>Goemaere</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Kaufman</surname><given-names>JM</given-names></name><name><surname>Rozenberg</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Reginster</surname><given-names>JY</g